---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "FSSAI Registration & Licensing Support | BRNDNUR Advisory LLP";
const description = "Understand FSSAI food business registration and licensing in India. Guidance on basic registration, state licensing, and compliance with BRNDNUR.";
const canonical = "https://brndnur.com/fssai-registration/";
---

<BaseLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  canonical={canonical}
  currentPath="/fssai-registration/"
>
  <main id="main-content">
    <!-- Breadcrumb & Hero -->
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <nav class="bn-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
          <a href="/">Home</a>
          <span class="sep">/</span>
          <a href="/services/">Services</a>
          <span class="sep">/</span>
          <span class="current">FSSAI Registration</span>
        </nav>
        <p class="eyebrow">Food Safety Compliance</p>
        <h1>FSSAI Food Business Registration & Licensing.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Under the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006, every food business operator (FBO)—from home bakers and cloud kitchens to manufacturers, packaged food brands, and distributors—must obtain an FSSAI license or registration prior to commercial operations.</p>
        
        <div class="hero-badges">
          <div class="hero-badge-item">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
            <span>Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-badge-item">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/></svg>
            <span>14-Digit FSSAI License Number</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-badge-item">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
            <span>1 to 5 Year Validity Options</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="actions" style="margin-top: 28px;">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://wa.me/919048188899?text=Hello%20BRNDNUR%2C%20I%20need%20FSSAI%20registration%20guidance." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Request FSSAI Assistance &rarr;</a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/packages/food-brand/">View Food Brand Package</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Split Visual Section -->
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="split-row">
          <div class="split-photo">
            <img src="/packages/assets/food-brand-package.webp" alt="BRNDNUR FSSAI food business licensing and registration advisory in Kerala" width="800" height="600" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="split-copy">
            <p class="eyebrow">Consumer Health & Law</p>
            <h2>Mandatory Compliance for Packaged Goods and Kitchens</h2>
            <p>Operating a food venture without a valid FSSAI license carries heavy statutory penalties under Section 63 of the Food Safety and Standards Act. Whether you produce traditional Malabar chips, packaged spices, bakery treats, or run a modern cloud kitchen, obtaining your 14-digit FSSAI number is legally required before retail distribution.</p>
            <p>BRNDNUR Advisory coordinates documentation—including kitchen layout blueprints, list of food categories, water test reports, and NOCs—submitting applications on the official FoSCoS portal to ensure timely inspection and approval.</p>
            <div class="advisory-notice" style="margin-top: 16px;">
              <div class="advisory-notice-icon">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="advisory-notice-content">
                <h4>Mandatory Labeling Rule</h4>
                <p>The 14-digit FSSAI registration/license number and the official FSSAI logo must be legibly printed on all packaged food labels, display boards, and restaurant menus under FSSAI Packaging & Labelling Regulations.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 3 Categories with Clean SVGs -->
    <section class="section section-alt">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading text-center">
          <p class="eyebrow">Classification Tiers</p>
          <h2>Basic Registration vs. State vs. Central License</h2>
          <p>The appropriate regulatory tier depends directly on your annual turnover and production capacity:</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-grid">
          <div class="bn-card">
            <div class="card-icon" style="color: #A8781A;">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m3 9 9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>FSSAI Basic Registration</h3>
            <p>For small-scale food business operators, cloud kitchens, home caterers, and petty retailers with an annual turnover up to ₹12 lakhs.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bn-card">
            <div class="card-icon" style="color: #A8781A;">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>FSSAI State License</h3>
            <p>For medium-scale manufacturers, storage facilities, transporters, food distributors, and restaurants with turnover between ₹12 lakhs and ₹20 crores.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bn-card">
            <div class="card-icon" style="color: #A8781A;">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>FSSAI Central License</h3>
            <p>For large-scale food processors, multi-state chain operators, food importers/exporters, and enterprises with turnover exceeding ₹20 crores.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FSSAI Criteria & Documents Matrix -->
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading text-center">
          <p class="eyebrow">Regulatory Matrix</p>
          <h2>FSSAI Licensing Thresholds & Criteria</h2>
          <p>Official classification standards under the FoSCoS portal.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bn-table-wrap">
          <table class="bn-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>License Type</th>
                <th>Turnover Eligibility</th>
                <th>Target Operations</th>
                <th>Mandatory Documentation</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Basic Registration</strong></td>
                <td>Up to ₹12 Lakhs per annum</td>
                <td>Home bakers, small stalls, cloud kitchens, petty vendors</td>
                <td>Photo ID, address proof, basic declaration</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>State License</strong></td>
                <td>₹12 Lakhs to ₹20 Crores per annum</td>
                <td>Restaurants, manufacturing units, repackagers, wholesalers</td>
                <td>Premises rent deed, layout plan, equipment list, water test report</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Central License</strong></td>
                <td>Above ₹20 Crores per annum</td>
                <td>Multi-state chains, 100% export units, seaport/airport vendors</td>
                <td>IE code (for export/import), recall plan, authorized lab reports</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Call to Action -->
    <section class="cta-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cta-panel">
          <p class="eyebrow">Launch Compliantly</p>
          <h2>Operating a Food or Beverage Enterprise?</h2>
          <p>We review your premise documents, kitchen declarations, and product categories to file on the official FoSCoS portal.</p>
          <div class="cta-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-gold" href="https://wa.me/919048188899?text=Hello%20BRNDNUR%2C%20I%20would%20like%20help%20with%20FSSAI%20licensing." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Consult on WhatsApp &rarr;</a>
            <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/packages/food-brand/">Explore Food Brand Package</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
